# Allowlist: ignore everything, then let back in only what the image needs.
# Safer than a blocklist: a new secret (.env) or a big folder can't slip into the build by accident.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!data/chroma/

# ...and never these, even inside the allowed folders.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
